WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.096
Wendy: I know you gave me stars for soup... but what's over there? I just have to check!

2
00:00:03.496 --> 00:00:05.464
Kai: Wendy, wait for me!

3
00:00:05.864 --> 00:00:09.656
Dingo: They're very curious. Try turning their curiosity up or down.

4
00:00:10.056 --> 00:00:12.096
Wendy: Wheee! Everything is so interesting!

5
00:00:12.496 --> 00:00:16.624
Kai: Um... I'll just stay here. I don't want to try anything new.

6
00:00:17.024 --> 00:00:19.952
Dingo: If they never try anything, they never find a star.

7
00:00:20.352 --> 00:00:27.264
Dingo: A little curious at first, then focused. That's how they find the best path. Trying lots of things at the start really helps!
